type: software
title: "rightsfoundry: The Rights Foundry Python SDK"
abstract: >-
  Official, zero-dependency Python SDK for The Rights Foundry API: royalty-free music
  for commercial and creative sync, with programmable licensing across 85,000+ tracks of
  cleared, human-made music. Search the catalog by filters,
  natural-language Deep Search or acoustic similarity, stream signed MP3 previews, and
  license WAV masters in one API call using prepaid credits.
